IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. REPORT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-AMOUNT   PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 1234567.89.
01 WS-SMALL    PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 42.50.
01 WS-EDITED   PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-MONEY    PIC $$,$$9.99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-ZERO     PIC ZZZ9 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    MOVE WS-AMOUNT TO WS-EDITED.
    DISPLAY "Amount: " WS-EDITED.
    MOVE WS-SMALL TO WS-MONEY.
    DISPLAY "Money:  " WS-MONEY.
    MOVE 7 TO WS-ZERO.
    DISPLAY "Padded: " WS-ZERO.
    STOP RUN.
